- Black a2, empty a1: post-fix `["a1=N","a1=B","a1=R","a1=Q"]` (K on b1), pre-fix `["a1=N","a1=B","a1=R+","a1=Q+"]` (K on c1) — the check suffix differs only because the king placement differs between my runs. The set of promotions is the same.
